lass=\"logo\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8b6cff\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#5b3df0\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"32\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#lg)\"/><path d=\"M9 16a7 7 0 1 0 7-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M16 5l3 4-4 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Tallyloop</span></span>\n<div class=\"nav\"><span data-go=\"features\">Features</span><span data-go=\"pricing\">Pricing</span><span data-go=\"about\">About</span><span data-go=\"contact\">Contact</span></div>\n<div class=\"h-cta\"><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"login\">Log in</span><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn\">Start free</span></div>\n</div></div>"}, "footer": "<div class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"f-grid\">\n<div><span data-go=\"index\" class=\"brand light\"><svg class=\"logo\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8b6cff\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#5b3df0\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"32\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#lg)\"/><path d=\"M9 16a7 7 0 1 0 7-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M16 5l3 4-4 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Tallyloop</span></span><p>Time tracking and invoicing for freelancers and small studios.</p></div>\n<div><p class=\"f-h\">Product</p><ul><li><span data-go=\"features\">Features</span></li><li><span data-go=\"pricing\">Pricing</span></li><li><span data-go=\"features\">Payment reminders</span></li></ul></div>\n<div><p class=\"f-h\">Company</p><ul><li><span data-go=\"about\">About</span></li><li><span data-go=\"contact\">Contact</span></li></ul></div>\n<div><p class=\"f-h\">Get started</p><p>Free for your first client. No card needed.</p><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-sm\">Start free</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"concept\">Concept project by Liam Curran: a fictional product. Customer names, quotes and figures are illustrative. <span class=\"ver\">This is the deliberately flawed \"before\" version.</span></p>\n</div></div>", "routes": {"index": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap center\">\n<span data-go=\"features\" class=\"announce\"><span>New</span> Automatic late-payment reminders <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span>\n<div class=\"h1\">Time tracking and invoicing for freelancers who'd rather be working</div>\n<p class=\"lede\">Start a timer, turn your hours into a professional invoice in two clicks, and let Tallyloop chase late payments for you.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas center\"><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg\">Start free</span><span data-go=\"features\" class=\"btn btn-lg ghost\">See how it works</span></div>\n<ul class=\"micro\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg> Free plan for your first client</li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg> No card needed</li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg> Cancel any time</li></ul>\n<div class=\"shot\"><div class=\"shot-frame\"><img class=\"shot-img\" src=\"assets/dashboard-screenshot-final-v3.png\"></div>\n<div class=\"float f1\"><span class=\"dot-run\"></span><div><strong>01:24:37</strong><small>Homepage redesign</small></div></div>\n<div class=\"float f2\"><span class=\"ok\"></span><div><strong>Invoice #1042 paid</strong><small>Northfield Studio · $2,400</small></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"logos\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p>Trusted by 9,000+ freelancers and small studios</p><div class=\"logo-row\"><span class=\"w1\">Northfield Studio</span><span class=\"w2\">Okafor &amp; Lee</span><span class=\"w3\">Brightside Co.</span><span class=\"w4\">Juniper Labs</span><span class=\"w5\">Pixelwell</span><span class=\"w6\">Marlow Copy</span></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</p><div class=\"h2\">Three steps from “start timer” to “paid”</div></div>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><span class=\"s-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4l2 2M9 2h6M12 2v3\"/></svg></span><strong>Track</strong><p>Hit start when you begin a task. Tag it to a client and project.</p></li><li><span class=\"s-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></span><strong>Invoice</strong><p>At month-end, turn tracked hours into a branded invoice and send it.</p></li><li><span class=\"s-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20M6 15h4\"/></svg></span><strong>Get paid</strong><p>Clients pay online. Tallyloop sends reminders if they don't.</p></li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap panels\"><div class=\"panel\" id=\"timer\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">01 · Track</p><div class=\"h2\">A timer that stays out of your way</div><p>Start tracking from any device in one click, tag the client and project, and get back to work. Tallyloop remembers your rates for each client.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Browser, desktop and mobile apps</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Add or edit time after the fact</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Idle detection, so a coffee break isn't billed</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-timer\"><div class=\"mh\"><strong>Today</strong><span>7h 24m</span></div><ul><li class=\"run\"><span><strong>Homepage redesign</strong><small>Northfield Studio</small></span><span class=\"dur\">1:24:37</span><span class=\"play stop\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Brand guidelines</strong><small>Juniper Labs</small></span><span class=\"dur\">2:10:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Client call</strong><small>Okafor &amp; Lee</small></span><span class=\"dur\">0:45:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Blog illustrations</strong><small>Pixelwell</small></span><span class=\"dur\">3:05:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"panel rev\" id=\"invoices\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">02 · Invoice</p><div class=\"h2\">From hours to a polished invoice in two clicks</div><p>Pick a client and date range. Tallyloop pulls in every tracked hour, applies your rates and builds a branded invoice ready to send.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Your logo, colours and payment terms</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Hourly, fixed-fee and expense lines</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Multi-currency for international clients</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-inv\">\n<div class=\"inv-top\"><span class=\"inv-logo\"></span><div><strong>Invoice #1043</strong><small>Due Dec 1 · Northfield Studio</small></div><span class=\"badge sent\">Sent</span></div>\n<div class=\"inv-rows\"><div><span>Homepage redesign · 18.5 h × $85</span><b>$1,572.50</b></div>\n<div><span>Design review calls · 3 h × $85</span><b>$255.00</b></div>\n<div><span>Stock photo licence</span><b>$49.00</b></div></div>\n<div class=\"inv-total\"><span>Total (CAD)</span><b>$1,876.50</b></div>\n<div class=\"inv-pay\">Pay by card</div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel\" id=\"reminders\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">03 · Get paid</p><div class=\"h2\">Late payments chase themselves</div><p>Clients pay by card straight from the invoice. If they don't, Tallyloop sends polite, automatic reminders on a schedule you set.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Reminders at 3, 7 and 14 days overdue</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Card payments land in days, not weeks</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>See who's opened, viewed and paid</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-remind\">\n<div class=\"mail\"><div class=\"mh\"><strong>Friendly reminder: Invoice #1040</strong><span>Auto · 3 days overdue</span></div>\n<p>Hi Alex, just a quick nudge that invoice #1040 for $960 was due on Nov 14. You can pay by card in a few seconds using the link below. Thanks!</p>\n<span class=\"mail-btn\">View &amp; pay invoice</span></div>\n<div class=\"toast\"><span class=\"ok\"></span><div><strong>Payment received</strong><small>Brightside Co. paid $960.00</small></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"section tint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Features</p><div class=\"h2\">Everything between “start timer” and “paid”</div>\n<p class=\"lede\">Three jobs, done well: track time, invoice it, get paid. No project-management suite, no fifty-tab settings page.</p></div>\n<div class=\"feat-grid\"><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4l2 2M9 2h6M12 2v3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">One-click timer</div><p>Track time from the browser, desktop or phone. Forgot to start it? Add hours later in seconds.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Hours to invoice in two clicks</div><p>Pick a client and a date range. Tallyloop builds the invoice from your tracked time and rates.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9\"/><path d=\"M10.3 21a1.9 1.9 0 0 0 3.4 0\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Polite payment reminders</div><p>Overdue invoices get friendly automatic reminders, so you never write an awkward email again.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20M6 15h4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Online card payments</div><p>Clients pay by card straight from the invoice. You see the payment the moment it lands.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Project budgets</div><p>Set hour or dollar budgets per project and get a heads-up at 80%, before you go over.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Tax-time exports</div><p>Export income and invoices by year or quarter as CSV or PDF for your accountant.</p></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n<div><strong>9,000+</strong><span>freelancers and studios</span></div><div><strong>2.4M</strong><span>hours tracked</span></div>\n<div><strong>$310M</strong><span>invoiced through Tallyloop</span></div><div><strong>11 days</strong><span>faster payment on average</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Loved by freelancers</p>\n<div class=\"h2\">Month-end, minus the afternoon</div><p class=\"rating-line\"><span class=\"stars\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg></span> <strong>4.8 / 5</strong> from 1,200+ reviews</p></div>\n<div class=\"reviews\"><div class=\"review\"><span class=\"stars\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg></span><div>“Month-end used to eat my whole Friday afternoon. Now I click two buttons and go for a run.”</div><div><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:#6a48f0\">M</span>\n<span><strong>Maya Chen</strong><small>Brand designer</small></span></div></div><div class=\"review\"><span class=\"stars\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg></span><div>“The automatic reminders alone paid for it. Two clients who always paid late now pay within a week.”</div><div><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:#0ea5e9\">J</span>\n<span><strong>Jordan Okafor</strong><small>Developer, Okafor &amp; Lee</small></span></div></div><div class=\"review\"><span class=\"stars\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z\"/></svg></span><div>“It does exactly three things and does them really well. I don't miss my old 40-tab setup.”</div><div><span class=\"av\" style=\"background:#f97316\">P</span>\n<span><strong>Priya Natarajan</strong><small>Copywriter</small></span></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</p><div class=\"h2\">Simple pricing that starts at free</div><p class=\"lede\">Prices in USD. Month-to-month, cancel any time.</p></div><div class=\"plans\"><div class=\"plan\"><div class=\"h3\">Free</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For trying it out with your first client.</p><p class=\"price\">$0<span>forever</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block ghost\">Start free</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>1 active client</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Unlimited time tracking</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>3 invoices per month</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"plan featured\"><span class=\"tag\">Most popular</span><div class=\"h3\">Solo</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For full-time freelancers.</p><p class=\"price\">$9<span>/month</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Try Solo free for 14 days</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Unlimited clients and invoices</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Online card payments</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Automatic reminders</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Project budgets</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"plan\"><div class=\"h3\">Studio</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For small studios and duos.</p><p class=\"price\">$19<span>/month</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block ghost\">Try Studio free for 14 days</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Everything in Solo</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Up to 5 team members</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Team timesheets and approvals</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Tax-time exports</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap faq-split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</p><div class=\"h2\">Common questions</div>\n<p>Something else? <span data-go=\"contact\">Ask a human</span>. We reply within one business day.</p></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Is there a free plan?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan covers one active client with unlimited time tracking and three invoices a month. Upgrade only when you need more.</p></details><details><summary>Can my clients pay online?</summary><p>Yes. On Solo and Studio, every invoice has a pay-by-card button. Card processing fees are charged by the payment provider.</p></details><details><summary>Can I import my existing time entries?</summary><p>You can import time entries from a CSV file, which most time trackers can export.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel any time?</summary><p>Yes. Plans are month-to-month, and you can export all your data before you leave.</p></details><details><summary>Is my data secure?</summary><p>Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and card payments are handled by a PCI-compliant payment provider. We never see card numbers.</p></details></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"cta-box\">\n<div class=\"h2\">Get your month-end afternoon back</div><p>Free for your first client. No card needed. Set up in under five minutes.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas center\"><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg light\">Start free</span><span data-go=\"features\" class=\"btn btn-lg ghost-light\">See all features</span></div>\n</div></div></div>", "features": "<div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"wrap center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Features</p><div class=\"h1\">Built for freelancers, not for project managers</div><p class=\"lede\">Three jobs, done well: track time, invoice it, get paid.</p></div></div><div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap panels\"><div class=\"panel\" id=\"timer\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">01 · Track</p><div class=\"h2\">A timer that stays out of your way</div><p>Start tracking from any device in one click, tag the client and project, and get back to work. Tallyloop remembers your rates for each client.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Browser, desktop and mobile apps</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Add or edit time after the fact</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Idle detection, so a coffee break isn't billed</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-timer\"><div class=\"mh\"><strong>Today</strong><span>7h 24m</span></div><ul><li class=\"run\"><span><strong>Homepage redesign</strong><small>Northfield Studio</small></span><span class=\"dur\">1:24:37</span><span class=\"play stop\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Brand guidelines</strong><small>Juniper Labs</small></span><span class=\"dur\">2:10:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Client call</strong><small>Okafor &amp; Lee</small></span><span class=\"dur\">0:45:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li><li class=\"\"><span><strong>Blog illustrations</strong><small>Pixelwell</small></span><span class=\"dur\">3:05:00</span><span class=\"play\"></span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"panel rev\" id=\"invoices\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">02 · Invoice</p><div class=\"h2\">From hours to a polished invoice in two clicks</div><p>Pick a client and date range. Tallyloop pulls in every tracked hour, applies your rates and builds a branded invoice ready to send.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Your logo, colours and payment terms</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Hourly, fixed-fee and expense lines</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Multi-currency for international clients</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-inv\">\n<div class=\"inv-top\"><span class=\"inv-logo\"></span><div><strong>Invoice #1043</strong><small>Due Dec 1 · Northfield Studio</small></div><span class=\"badge sent\">Sent</span></div>\n<div class=\"inv-rows\"><div><span>Homepage redesign · 18.5 h × $85</span><b>$1,572.50</b></div>\n<div><span>Design review calls · 3 h × $85</span><b>$255.00</b></div>\n<div><span>Stock photo licence</span><b>$49.00</b></div></div>\n<div class=\"inv-total\"><span>Total (CAD)</span><b>$1,876.50</b></div>\n<div class=\"inv-pay\">Pay by card</div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel\" id=\"reminders\"><div class=\"panel-copy\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">03 · Get paid</p><div class=\"h2\">Late payments chase themselves</div><p>Clients pay by card straight from the invoice. If they don't, Tallyloop sends polite, automatic reminders on a schedule you set.</p><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Reminders at 3, 7 and 14 days overdue</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Card payments land in days, not weeks</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>See who's opened, viewed and paid</span></li></ul>\n<span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"link-arrow\">Start free <svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"panel-mock\"><div class=\"mock mock-remind\">\n<div class=\"mail\"><div class=\"mh\"><strong>Friendly reminder: Invoice #1040</strong><span>Auto · 3 days overdue</span></div>\n<p>Hi Alex, just a quick nudge that invoice #1040 for $960 was due on Nov 14. You can pay by card in a few seconds using the link below. Thanks!</p>\n<span class=\"mail-btn\">View &amp; pay invoice</span></div>\n<div class=\"toast\"><span class=\"ok\"></span><div><strong>Payment received</strong><small>Brightside Co. paid $960.00</small></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section tint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Features</p><div class=\"h2\">Plus the details that save you time</div>\n<p class=\"lede\">Three jobs, done well: track time, invoice it, get paid. No project-management suite, no fifty-tab settings page.</p></div>\n<div class=\"feat-grid\"><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4l2 2M9 2h6M12 2v3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">One-click timer</div><p>Track time from the browser, desktop or phone. Forgot to start it? Add hours later in seconds.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Hours to invoice in two clicks</div><p>Pick a client and a date range. Tallyloop builds the invoice from your tracked time and rates.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9\"/><path d=\"M10.3 21a1.9 1.9 0 0 0 3.4 0\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Polite payment reminders</div><p>Overdue invoices get friendly automatic reminders, so you never write an awkward email again.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20M6 15h4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Online card payments</div><p>Clients pay by card straight from the invoice. You see the payment the moment it lands.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Project budgets</div><p>Set hour or dollar budgets per project and get a heads-up at 80%, before you go over.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Tax-time exports</div><p>Export income and invoices by year or quarter as CSV or PDF for your accountant.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n<div><strong>9,000+</strong><span>freelancers and studios</span></div><div><strong>2.4M</strong><span>hours tracked</span></div>\n<div><strong>$310M</strong><span>invoiced through Tallyloop</span></div><div><strong>11 days</strong><span>faster payment on average</span></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"cta-box\">\n<div class=\"h2\">Get your month-end afternoon back</div><p>Free for your first client. No card needed. Set up in under five minutes.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas center\"><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg light\">Start free</span><span data-go=\"features\" class=\"btn btn-lg ghost-light\">See all features</span></div>\n</div></div></div>", "pricing": "<div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"wrap center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</p><div class=\"h1\">Simple pricing that starts at free</div><p class=\"lede\">Prices in USD. Month-to-month. Cancel any time and take your data with you.</p></div></div><div class=\"section pt0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"h2 sr-only\">Plans</div><div class=\"plans\"><div class=\"plan\"><div class=\"h3\">Free</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For trying it out with your first client.</p><p class=\"price\">$0<span>forever</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block ghost\">Start free</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>1 active client</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Unlimited time tracking</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>3 invoices per month</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"plan featured\"><span class=\"tag\">Most popular</span><div class=\"h3\">Solo</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For full-time freelancers.</p><p class=\"price\">$9<span>/month</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Try Solo free for 14 days</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Unlimited clients and invoices</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Online card payments</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Automatic reminders</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Project budgets</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"plan\"><div class=\"h3\">Studio</div><p class=\"plan-sub\">For small studios and duos.</p><p class=\"price\">$19<span>/month</span></p><span data-go=\"contact\" class=\"btn btn-block ghost\">Try Studio free for 14 days</span><ul class=\"ticks\"><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Everything in Solo</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Up to 5 team members</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Team timesheets and approvals</span></li><li><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>Tax-time exports</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section tint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><div class=\"h2\">Every plan, side by side</div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"compare\"><thead><tr><th>Compare plans</th><th>Free</th><th>Solo</th><th>Studio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Active clients</th><td>1</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th>Time tracking</th><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th>Invoices per month</th><td>3</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th>Online card payments</th><td>–</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th>Automatic reminders</th><td>–</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th>Project budgets</th><td>–</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th>Team members</th><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>Up to 5</td></tr><tr><th>Timesheet approvals</th><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><th>Tax-time exports</th><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>✓</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap faq-split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</p><div class=\"h2\">Common questions</div>\n<p>Something else? <span data-go=\"contact\">Ask a human</span>. We reply within one business day.</p></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Is there a free plan?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan covers one active client with unlimited time tracking and three invoices a month. Upgrade only when you need more.</p></details><details><summary>Can my clients pay online?</summary><p>Yes. On Solo and Studio, every invoice has a pay-by-card button. Card processing fees are charged by the payment provider.</p></details><details><summary>Can I import my existing time entries?</summary><p>You can import time entries from a CSV file, which most time trackers can export.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel any time?</summary><p>Yes. Plans are month-to-month, and you can export all your data before you leave.</p></details><details><summary>Is my data secure?</summary><p>Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and card payments are handled by a PCI-compliant payment provider. We never see card numbers.</p></details></div></div></div><div class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"cta-box\">\n<div class=\"h2\">Get your month-end afternoon back</div><p>Free for your first client. No card needed. Set up in under five minutes.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas center\"><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg light\">Start free</span><span data-go=\"features\" class=\"btn btn-lg ghost-light\">See all features</span></div>\n</div></div></div>", "about": "<div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"wrap center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">About</p><div class=\"h1\">Built because month-end took an afternoon</div></div></div><div class=\"section pt0\"><div class=\"wrap narrow prose\">\n<p class=\"big\">Tallyloop started as a spreadsheet. Its founder was freelancing as a designer, tracking hours in one app, building invoices in another and chasing payments by email. Every month-end took an afternoon.</p>\n<p>We built Tallyloop to make that afternoon take five minutes. It does three things well: tracks time, turns that time into invoices and gets those invoices paid. That's it. No project-management suite, no CRM, no fifty-tab settings page.</p>\n<p>We're a small, independent team, and we answer support emails ourselves.</p></div></div><div class=\"section tint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sec-head center\"><div class=\"h2\">What we believe</div></div><div class=\"feat-grid three\"><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Fast by default</div><p>Every screen loads quickly and every common task takes two clicks or fewer.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21.2l8.8-8.8a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Small on purpose</div><p>We build three things well instead of thirty things badly.</p></div><div class=\"feat\"><span class=\"f-ico\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"h3\">Your data is yours</div><p>Export everything, any time, in plain CSV and PDF.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n<div><strong>9,000+</strong><span>freelancers and studios</span></div><div><strong>2.4M</strong><span>hours tracked</span></div>\n<div><strong>$310M</strong><span>invoiced through Tallyloop</span></div><div><strong>11 days</strong><span>faster payment on average</span></div>\n</div></div><div class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"cta-box\">\n<div class=\"h2\">Get your month-end afternoon back</div><p>Free for your first client. No card needed. Set up in under five minutes.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas center\"><span data-go=\"pricing\" class=\"btn btn-lg light\">Start free</span><span data-go=\"features\" class=\"btn btn-lg ghost-light\">See all features</span></div>\n</div></div></div>", "contact": "<div class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"wrap center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Contact</p><div class=\"h1\">Talk to a human</div><p class=\"lede\">We reply within one business day, usually much sooner.</p></div></div><div class=\"section pt0\"><div class=\"wrap contact-grid\">\n<form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contact\" novalidate>\n<div><div class=\"lbl\">Name</div><input id=\"n\" name=\"name\" required></div>\n<div><div class=\"lbl\">Email</div><input id=\"e\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required></div>\n<div><div class=\"lbl\">Topic</div><select id=\"t\" name=\"topic\"><option>Question before signing up</option><option>Help with my account</option><option>Billing</option><option>Something else</option></select></div>\n<div><div class=\"lbl\">Message</div><textarea id=\"q\" name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" required></textarea></div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"submit\">Send message</button>\n<p class=\"form-msg\">Thanks! This is a concept site, so nothing was sent.</p></form>\n<div class=\"contact-cards\">\n<div class=\"c-card\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 6-10 7L2 6\"/></svg><div><strong>Email</strong><p><span data-go=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">hello@example.com</span></p></div></div>\n<div class=\"c-card\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg><div><strong>In-app chat</strong><p>Weekdays, 9am–5pm Eastern.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"c-card\"><svg class=\"i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V2H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 4.5z\"/><path d=\"M4 19.5V22h16\"/></svg><div><strong>Help centre</strong><p>Step-by-step guides for every feature.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div>"}}